         <SecondaryPreamble>
            <EnactingText>
               <Para>
                  <Text>The Secretary of State makes these Regulations with the consent of the Treasury<FootnoteRef Ref="f00001"/> in exercise of the powers conferred by sections 68(1), (7), (10)(a), (b), (c)(iii), 69(2) and 74(8)(a), (b) and (c) of the Immigration Act 2014<FootnoteRef Ref="f00002"/>. These Regulations are made further to provision in the Immigration and Nationality (Fees) Order 2016<FootnoteRef Ref="f00003"/>.</Text>
               </Para>
            </EnactingText>
